<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Oryx Dec qtr gold output drops.</title>
<headline>Oryx Dec qtr gold output drops.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-December versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 80.68 vs 82.21</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		  116,000 vs 167,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		   419 vs 437</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     3.6 vs 2.6</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	     55,735 vs 54,919</p>
<p>Full name: Oryx Mine, a division of St Helena Gold Mines Ltd managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
